-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5db1d6693acaf11ee2b5e6a6b29e932db3e92b24\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5db1d6693acaf11ee2b5e6a6b29e932db3e92b24\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"530\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2cc348a0f458f423834b9de5b6e52c23021d9a8f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2cc348a0f458f423834b9de5b6e52c23021d9a8f\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"396\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">사진은 우수작 예시 입니다~<br><br>사진을 찍어 직접 sns에 올리면 사탕을 준다고 하니 대부분의 학생들이 sns, 프로필 사진에 해두기도 했습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/606e689ae4eccd2b73936b8e2ef6e784da0a5165\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/606e689ae4eccd2b73936b8e2ef6e784da0a5165\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"460\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52aa2edc3c59823124f4510526c75b1e44fb6d77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52aa2edc3c59823124f4510526c75b1e44fb6d77\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"750\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/118d05aa61f3746ec66c22d27923e2643d483539\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/118d05aa61f3746ec66c22d27923e2643d483539\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"787\"></div>\n